{"id":"ponachalu","lemma":"поначалу","pos":"adv","rank":2872,"glosses":["at first, in the beginning, initially"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/76/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%87%D0%B0%D0%BB%D1%83.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%87%D0%B0%D0%BB%D1%83.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Поначалу было трудно.","en":"It was hard at first.","words":[null,{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"it is difficult, hard"}]},{"text":"Поначалу я его не узнал.","en":"I didn't recognize him at first.","words":[null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"him / his"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to recognize","l":"узнать"}]},{"text":"Поначалу это сложно.","en":"At first, it is difficult.","words":[null,{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"in a complicated manner"}]},{"text":"Я так и думал поначалу.","en":"I thought so at first.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"so"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"to think","l":"думать"},null]},{"text":"Поначалу я не мог этого понять.","en":"At the beginning, I couldn't understand it.","words":[null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},null,{"g":"to understand"}]}]}